Productive Bee Automation

Name "Productive Bee Automation"
    -- This Program takes output from beehives from combs to finished processing
Every tick do
    -- Input power to everything that needs it
    Input fe:: from EnderCell
    Output fe:: to Centrifuge, Furnace
End

Every 20 ticks do
    -- Taking honey from centrifuges into casting basins
    Input fluid:: from Centrifuge
    Output fluid:: to Basin
Forget
    -- Take honey blocks from basins to Barrel1
    Input honey_block from Basin
    Output honey_block to Barrel1
End

Every 20 Ticks do
    -- Taking Combs from hives to centrifuges
    Input *Comb* from Hive
    Output *Comb* to Centrifuge
Forget
    --Taking comb outputs from centrifuge to Barrel1
    Input from Centrifuge slots 2-10
    Output to Barrel1
Forget
    -- Take raw materials from barrel1 to furnace to process
    Input *raw* from Barrel1
    Output *raw* to Furnace
Forget
    -- Take finished materials from furnace to Barrel2
    Input from Furnace bottom side slots 13
    Input from Furnace bottom side slots 14
    Input from Furnace bottom side slots 15
    Input from Furnace bottom side slots 16
    Input from Furnace bottom side slots 17
    Input from Furnace bottom side slots 18
    Output to Barrel2
End
